---
description: >-
  Label syntax (#1368): axis and legend labels written as plain markdown, a quoted markdown
  string (with double and with single quotes), a code span, tags and a written \n; only the
  markdown strings are bold and italic. The title is in bare backticks, which is plain text
  (D733). Axis and curve labels are always quoted, so they have no bare form.
---
radar-beta
  title `title **bold** _ital_`
  axis a["axis **bold** _ital_"], b["`axis **bold** _ital_`"], c['`axis single **bold**`']
  axis d["axis a `code` b"], e["axis <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"]
  axis f["axis one\ntwo"]
  curve p["curve **bold** _ital_"]{1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6}
  curve q["`curve **bold** _ital_`"]{6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1}
  curve r["curve a `code` b"]{3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3}
  curve s["curve <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"]{2, 4, 2, 4, 2, 4}
  curve t["curve one\ntwo"]{5, 1, 5, 1, 5, 1}
  max 6
